Keep a shared emails as an empty list of text.
Place "test.email+alex@leetcode.com" into emails.
Place "test.e.mail+bob.cathy@leetcode.com" into emails.
Place "testemail+david@lee.tcode.com" into emails.
Keep a shared ordered as an empty list of text.
Keep a shared built as empty text.

To normalize from position (a whole number).
The email is item position of emails.
The size is the number of characters in email.
Set built to empty text.
The at is 0, while the skipping is 0, while the keep is 0, while the dot is 0, while the plus is 0, while the sign is 0.
For every spot from 0 to size minus 1.
Set keep to 0.
Set dot to 0.
Set plus to 0.
Set sign to 0.
The here is the slice of email from spot to spot plus 1.
If here matches ".", set dot to 1.
If here matches "+", set plus to 1.
If here matches "@", set sign to 1.
If at is 0 and skipping is 0, set keep to 1.
If at is 1, set keep to 1.
If at is 0 and dot is 1, set keep to 0.
If sign is 1, set keep to 0.
If at is 0 and plus is 1, set keep to 0.
If plus is 1, set skipping to 1.
If keep is 1, Place here into built.
If sign is 1 and at is 0, Place "@" into built.
If sign is 1, set at to 1.

For every position from 0 to the last position of emails.
Normalize from position.
Place built into ordered.

The last is the last position of ordered.
For every left from 0 to last.
For every right from left to last.
The rightword is item right of ordered.
The leftword is item left of ordered.
If rightword comes before leftword, swap item left of ordered and item right of ordered.

The count is 1.
For every position from 1 to last.
The here is item position of ordered.
The prior is item (position minus 1) of ordered.
If here does not match prior, add 1 to count.

Show count.
